  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Adolescent Girls Education (SAGE) II Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project builds on SAGE Phase 1. In this Phase, the OU will:- Assist in the development of reading scheme materials which are inclusive and gender responsive, providing consultative support to the delivery organisation.- Assist in the development of an inclusive education toolkit for community educators. - Develop research papers, learning papers and documentaries showcasing project evidence on what works for supporting out of school girls&apos; access to education.- providing ongoing technical support with a focus on teaching and learning quality- providing support  the Community of Reflective Practice (CORP) strand.</narrative>
  </description>
